    "Cuenta creada, pero el servidor pide confirmar el email y no envía correos. Avisa a quien administra PennyNote.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Account created, but the server requires email confirmation and doesn't send emails. Tell whoever manages PennyNote."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "账户已创建，但服务器要求确认邮箱且不会发送邮件。请联系 PennyNote 的管理员。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Debe quedar al menos una categoría.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "There must be at least one category."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "至少需要保留一个类别。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Demasiados intentos. Espera unos minutos y vuelve a probar.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Too many attempts. Wait a few minutes and try again."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "尝试次数过多。请等几分钟后再试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
